{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"duzhou-p2-laiyan","name":"来艳（来敏父）","evidence":["duzhou-q2-5bbd544679e2292c5723","duzhou-q2-6cb9d477bf685354ef05"],"facts":[{"id":"duzhou-f2-fad519aaf8089a539d73","text":"来艳为来敏之父，汉司空；华峤《后汉书》记其开馆养徒、灵帝时位至司空。","evidence":["duzhou-q2-5bbd544679e2292c5723","duzhou-q2-6cb9d477bf685354ef05"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"duzhou-q2-5bbd544679e2292c5723","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-a12cd788d089945628c2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞华峤《后汉书》曰：“艳，好学下士，开馆养徒众。少历显位，灵帝时位至司空。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-862f1cea78d66bb10b3e","start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q2-6cb9d477bf685354ef05","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-c50e18738e0ca7813a82","layer":"original","quote":"来敏字敬达，义阳新野人。来歙之后也〖1〗。父艳〖2〗，为汉司空。﹝一﹞汉末大乱，敏随姊（夫）奔荆州。姊夫黄琬是刘璋祖母之侄，故璋遣迎琬妻；敏遂俱与姊入蜀，常为璋宾客。涉猎书籍，善左氏《春秋》〖3〗，尤精于《仓》、《雅》训诂〖4〗，好是正文字〖5〗。","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
